ushes"],"finding":"Approach 1 routes the reconciler snapshot through commit_and_push_tickets_branch, which pushes to origin, but today's _commit_binding_store_snapshot only stages+commits (no push); the plan does not classify this newly-introduced push as in/out of scope. Approach 2 acknowledges 'no push, matching today's no-push behavior,' showing the two approaches differ in observable behavior, yet approach 1 leaves the push behavior unclassified.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fbb75535f3540ec29","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach (one of), option 1","norm_id":"n4f9960433a5c7097","priority":0.875,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An idempotent reconciler pass that now commits AND pushes the tickets branch where it previously only committed locally, altering push cadence/network behavior between passes"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Add an acceptance criterion that the binding-store snapshot commit remains local-only (no push), and if approach 1 is chosen, have the pathspec code path skip the push (or gate the push off) so behavior matches today's add+commit-only semantics.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"missing_oracle","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"uncertifiable_outcome","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"State explicitly whether the converted path pushes; if approach 1 is chosen, specify how the added push (push.py:456) is suppressed or justified so behavior matches today's no-push inline commit.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.275,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["push.py:456 `push_tickets_branch(canonical, strict=strict)` runs after the locked commit","Approach 2 text: 'no push, matching today's no-push behavior' — approach 1 carries no equivalent qualifier","Current helper commits inline with no push (reconcile_helpers.py:255-284)"],"finding":"Approach 1 routes through commit_and_push_tickets_branch, which unconditionally PUSHES (push.py:456), whereas the current _commit_binding_store_snapshot is inline no-push; the plan does not reconcile this behavior change for approach 1, and only approach 2 is annotated 'no push, matching today's no-push behavior'.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f8c25a1429a2561c8","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach (both options) / AC list","norm_id":"nb26f6386d27ccd0f","priority":0.875,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Every idempotent pass under approach 1 would trigger an extra tickets-branch push, changing sync/network behavior and possibly HEAD/remote churn"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanatio